// Chuvash / Чӑвашла (chv) — the SOLE surviving Oghur (Bulgaric) Turkic language, CYRILLIC. Referee: English Wiktionary
// 'Chuvash terms with IPA pronunciation' (84 literal human {{IPA|cv|…}} pairs; no wikipron/epitran chv). Single-source.
